  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup olive oil",
    "1 tablespoon minced garlic",
    "2 teaspoons lemon juice",
    "0.25 teaspoon pepper",
    "1 pinch finely chopped parsley",
    "1 pound frozen shrimp, thawed and peeled",
    "metal skewers",
    "cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XN3k06y-tlPJ1MKCXvOxbT1KETk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273793-Garlic-Shrimp-Kabobs-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-1f52f44c3da24d28880e7c214882af31.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273793/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk olive oil, garlic, lemon juice, pepper, and parsley together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KXd4LVtUYAHxovGLZ8exyhdx_QQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273793-Garlic-Shrimp-Kabobs-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-6beddedbe34c417bb75eb5c1e2fac237.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273793/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into a large resealable plastic bag. Add shrimp, coat with the marinade, squeeze out excess air, and seal the bag. Marinate in the refrigerator for 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/d00gCGSQQKTOW9Ne-RO5B13jdj8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273793-Garlic-Shrimp-Kabobs-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-edf858d8d6c945d287e97a55f1848444.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273793/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat and lightly oil the grate. Lightly coat metal skewers with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uXDeTAH_7PsI_GKeItqEt8wNVzg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273793-Garlic-Shrimp-Kabobs-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-6338d7d6fd194c4c94a089cc09b0c069.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273793/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove shrimp from the marinade and shake off excess. Discard the remaining marinade. Place about 5 shrimp on each skewer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Fh_WPFK0m3D2JGKDEo08BA8xPGo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273793-Garlic-Shrimp-Kabobs-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-bbe8722a14504a829e68afc2d568e6ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273793/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on the preheated grill until shrimp are bright pink on the outside and the meat is opaque, about 5 minutes; do not overcook.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/srrk8Z43Z4yZWI00U9_ukBMSxNE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273793-Garlic-Shrimp-Kabobs-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-08-1f9dfd760f2741a68e3c46276b59412f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/273793/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with lemon wedges, if desired, and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-EPVFB_A8ZO1a1uqEGI0N_AaddM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-273793-Garlic-Shrimp-Kabobs-gw-ddmfs-beauty-4x3-618a5be02f234fcb975cdb8ec84282e4.jpg"
